{"parse": {"title": "BBT-03", "pageid": 88295, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-02\" title=\"BBT-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">BBT-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/BBT-04\" title=\"BBT-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">BBT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.89.E5.AD.A6.E8.BF.B7.E5.BD.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"光学迷彩\">光学迷彩</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 光学迷彩</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Illusions of Light</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>神<span class=\"color-value\"></span>秘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>学<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>戏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>微<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192003</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊吵闹，不时传来混乱的吉他声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>客房卧室里的摇滚海盗拿起电话，拨通前台的内部号码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗需要……呃需要一些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她夹着电话听筒，胡乱翻找着急救手册中的相关内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>一些生理盐水！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>是的，是的，301房间，需要生理盐水，然后……植物营养液。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>对，就是这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>呼，这样应该就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">吵闹的年轻人：</div><div>你们干什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">吵闹的年轻人：</div><div>我说过了我没有——唔唔——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿，你们在干什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗打开门探出头，看向走廊里骚乱传来的方向，但却没能见到半个人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>真是一个神奇的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不多久后，旅店侍从送来了她要求的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>浸泡在浓度0.9%的生理盐水中，持续一分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗照着基金会急救手册将同伴放入杯中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>真的有用吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她盯着墙上挂钟，默数时间一、二、三……直到六十。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-500902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-500902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-500902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"134\" data-file-height=\"112\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>咳……咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杯子里飘出气泡，她赶忙将苹果先生拎出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长？APPLe某记得……应该在一条公路边……这是哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>淘金镇，一个海图上没有标注的“孤岛”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢，你当时晕倒了，一位好心的司机女士载着我们来了这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你脱水了，险些变成一个干瘪的苹果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苹果先生恢复了他的活力，至少是恢复了一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们的假期计划或许要做一点调整。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>航线向来由船长决定，APPLe某没有意见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>面对这地方奇奇怪怪的禁令，嘿，我们就该让大伙儿尝尝真正的自由精神！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>更别提他们还禁止神秘术呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>例行检查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>例行检查，小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>开门吧，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>海关税员吗？来检查船舱里的每一颗麦子，然后对它们课税？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe认为，这儿半径两百英里范围内应该没有海，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>好吧APPLe先生，但我突然有了个想法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>怎么能让这些家伙得逞呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术的辉光悄悄闪烁，将摇滚海盗隐匿在光亮之下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>没人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个崭新的、收拾整齐的卧室房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗苹果，系着绅士领结，被放置在枕头边，以彰显酒店的高雅品味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的光学把戏骗过了警卫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>可议员大人说过，目标就在这附近……藏起来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他走进房间，检查了每一处能躲藏的地方——但他看不见被光影藏起来的摇滚海盗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-505801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">城镇警卫Ⅰ：</div><div>好吧，也许是弄错了房门号，早就说过神秘术什么的，都不靠谱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>呼……莱莉可没告诉我这地方还有这样的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>APPLe先生，你演得不错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>咳咳……APPLe某只是沉默地躺在枕头边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>人们一般管这叫“本色出演”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>但我搞不明白，他们在做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>也许是把我们当成了弹吉他扰民的旅客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警卫来过之后，先前不时传来的吉他声倒是消失不见了。旅馆内静悄悄的，街上的广播音乐顺着窗流进房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>必须要说，我不喜欢这个镇子，尤其是品位糟糕的广播音乐和那些禁令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>他们禁止摇滚乐演出，也禁止神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>噢，这么说来，船长，你已经成为这儿的通缉犯了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>是吗？很好！这将是本海盗的又一个荣誉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我明白了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>本海盗只要站在那儿，就会吸引当局的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>看来我们的名声已经从伦敦传到了这个莫名其妙的淘金镇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>是的船长，从普利茅斯的造船厂到洛杉矶的唐人街，我们的名字已经无人不知无人不晓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>但为什么旅馆会有警卫来“例行检查”呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摇滚海盗不解地思考着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>神秘学家得登记身份？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不许在床上吃巧克力？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>还不许摇滚乐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>该死的，本海盗不仅要干这些事，还要把它们放在一块儿一起干！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她取出一袋从基金会“偷”出的N&amp;N's红绿圣诞巧克力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再抱出背包中的唱片机，连接音箱，检查唱针，放上心爱的唱片，再定位好音臂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哼哼～♪</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-302511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>然后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后她“消失”在灯光之下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"cg_xingtiyaogun\"><img alt=\"cg_xingtiyaogun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png/600px-Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png/900px-Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png/1200px-Cg-cg_xingtiyaogun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>艺术自由！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她高呼着——并且咬下巧克力，如同一只贪吃的小耗子咬断电线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>船长，照目前的情况来看，我们失去了某项重要的能源供应……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "BBT-03"}}